@* Message turns the label red, replaces the description, and is announced —
   FormMessage carries role="alert" because the error arrives after a submit, when focus is
   somewhere else. With no Message, nothing renders at all: an empty <p> would open a hole
   under every valid field. *@
<div class="w-[360px]">
    <FormField For="phone" Label="Phone" Description="Digits only."
               Message="That does not look like a phone number.">
        <Input id="phone" name="phone" value="+44 abc" aria-invalid="true" />
    </FormField>
</div>
